tMillis() = -100 new Period(-100).toString() = PT0.100S The last line should produce \"PT-0.100S\" instead of \"PT0.100S\". Discussion Stephen Colebourne - 2012-09-03 Fixed in GitHub, thanks https://github.com/JodaOrg/joda-time/commit/5d08a1cdbfa6ce86a0baf637493c464e91e91968 If you would like to refer to this comment somewhere else in this project, copy and paste the following link: Log in to post a comment. \u2715",
